{"type":"message","id":"080465f8","parentId":"aa42e4ca","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:27.257Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting. The scheduler DID trigger the wake-up at 06:30 today, and breakfast at 07:30. But the wake-up message says \"🔔 触发任务: 06:30 (wake)\" but I don't see a corresponding \"✅ 推送成功\" for the wake-up! The breakfast also doesn't have a success message.\n\nLooking at the log more carefully:\n- 06:30:13 - Triggered wake task, no \"✅ 推送成功\" \n- 06:30:32 - Scheduler restarted, triggered wake again, no success\n- 06:31:38 - Scheduler restarted again\n- 07:30:08 - Triggered breakfast, but no success message either\n- 07:30:24 - Restarted, triggered again\n- 07:31:30 - Restarted again\n\nSo the wake-up and breakfast messages were triggered but never successfully pushed! There's no \"✅ 推送成功\" line for them. This is the problem - the messages triggered but failed to deliver.\n\nAlso I notice the scheduler keeps restarting every few seconds (\"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\" repeats frequently). This suggests it's crashing and being restarted by a watchdog or something.\n\nLet me look at the push function in the script to understand what could cause silent failures - it seems like the push succeeded but maybe the Feishu token is having issues. Let me check the script further.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully - there are NO \"✅ 推送成功\" lines for the wake and breakfast tasks today. So the messages were triggered but the push failed silently. This could be a token issue, API error, or the scheduler process keeps crashing before it can complete the push.\n\nThe user is asking \"那为啥没有叫我起床\" - this confirms they ARE 老公 (yuki), using a different display name in this group. They didn't receive the wake-up message despite the scheduler triggering it.\n\nLet me check if there are any error logs or failed pushes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_XKtpfX3wfte89ypAZBqe0639","name":"exec","