{"type":"message","id":"6fcd88da","parentId":"5cb320c8","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:32.583Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed: the wake task at 06:30 and breakfast at 07:30 were triggered but NEVER completed with \"✅ 推送成功\". All 7 success marks are from earlier days. The scheduler seems to be crashing/restarting rapidly during the push phase.\n\nThe problem is likely:\n1. The push to Feishu API is failing (maybe token issue or API error)\n2. The scheduler crashes on error and then gets restarted\n\nLet me check the script's push function to understand error handling, and also check if there was a Feishu token renewal issue.\n\nActually, let me first try to test the push by sending a test message to understand the error.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_RevxvqU04tWZseFLRHVG8101","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -A30 \"def send_to_feishu\" ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py 2>/dev/null","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":258,"output":371,"cacheRead":24320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24949,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780193127573}}
