{"type":"message","id":"0c6ca991","parentId":"7bfa4b1b","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:37.809Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ET_cRsdJ02Aq5Z14Mx5PsjD5507","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py","offset":112,"limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":140,"output":91,"cacheRead":24832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25063,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780193135508}}
{"type":"message","id":"67cf5dcd","parentId":"0c6ca991","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:37.957Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_cRsdJ02Aq5Z14Mx5PsjD5507","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def send_message(text):\n    \"\"\"发送飞书消息\"\"\"\n    token = get_token()\n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n        headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n        json={\n            \"receive_id\": CHAT_ID,\n            \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n            \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": text})\n        },\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    if data.get(\"code\") == 0:\n        log(f\"✅ 推送成功: {text[:30]}...\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        log(f\"❌ 推送失败: {data.get('msg')}\")\n        return False\n\ndef get_weather():\n    \"\"\"查询东莞天气\"\"\"\n    try:\n        import subprocess\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            [\"curl\", \"-s\", f\"wttr.in/{WEATHER_CITY}?format=%c+%t+(体感%f)+%w+湿度%h\"],\n            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10\n        )\n        if result.returncode == 0 and result.stdout.strip():\n            return result.stdout.strip()\n    except Exception as e:\n        log(f\"⚠️ 天气查询失败: {e}\")\n    return None\n\ndef get_bj_time():\n    return datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8)))\n\ndef main():\n    log(\"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\")\n    sent_today = set()\n    import random\n    \n    # 每天每种任务随机选一条话术（同一天同一任务固定）\n    daily_msgs = {}  # type -> message\n    \n    while True:\n        now = get_bj_time()\n        date_key = now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n        current_minutes = now.hour * 60 + now.minute\n\n[33 more lines in file. Use offset=162 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780193137943}}
{"type":"message","id":"5b900c11","parentId":"67cf5dcd","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:45.649Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue. The `send_message` function pushes to Feishu API. It gets the token and sends the message. The log shows \"🔔 触发任务\" but no \"✅ 推送成功\" or \"❌ 推送失败\" — which means the process crashed before reaching the `send_message` return logging.\n\nLooking at the main loop, the scheduler restarts frequently. The fact that there are multiple \"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\" at close intervals (06:30:13, 06:30:32, 06:31:38) suggests the process is crashing and being restarted.\n\nLet me read the main loop to understand the full flow, and also check if there's a watchdog restarting it.\n\nAlso, I note that between `log(f\"🔔 触发任务: {hhmm} ({task_type})\")` and `log(f\"✅ 推送成功: ...\")` there's a call to `send_message(text)`. If the process crashes during `send_message`, we'd see the trigger log but no success/failure log.\n\nPossible causes:\n1. Token fetch fails and crashes (unhandled exception in `get_token`)\n2. Network timeout/error in `requests.post` without proper exception handling\n3. Something else in the main loop that crashes\n\nLet me read the full main function and the get_token function.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_1ov9T9LkHY7diPe7vBny5965","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":85,"limit":30,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_MaBPajMyjCLjSxWkLPLV0855","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":150,"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":550,"output":728,"cacheRead":24960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26238,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780193137962}}
{"type":"message","id":"032f302d","parentId":"5b900c11","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:45.757Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_1ov9T9LkHY7diPe7vBny5965","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\ndef get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取飞书 token\"\"\"\n    if TOKEN_FILE.exists():\n        try:\n            with open(TOKEN_FILE) as f:\n                data = json.load(f)\n            expire = data.get(\"expire\", 0)\n            if time.time() < expire - 300:\n                return data.get(\"token\")\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n        json={\"app_id\": FEISHU_APP_ID, \"app_secret\": FEISHU_APP_SECRET},\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    token = data.get(\"tenant_access_token\")\n    expire = int(data.get(\"expire\", 7200))\n    \n    with open(TOKEN_FILE, 'w') as f:\n        json.dump({\"token\": token, \"expire\": time.time() + expire}, f)\n    \n    return token\n\ndef send_message(text):\n    \"\"\"发送飞书消息\"\"\"\n    token = get_token()\n\n[80 more lines in file. Use offset=115 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780193145744}}
{"type":"message","id":"9d86574f","parentId":"032f302d","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:45.772Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_MaBPajMyjCLjSxWkLPLV0855","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def main():\n    log(\"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\")\n    sent_today = set()\n    import random\n    \n    # 每天每种任务随机选一条话术（同一天同一任务固定）\n    daily_msgs = {}  # type -> message\n    \n    while True:\n        now = get_bj_time()\n        date_key = now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n        current_minutes = now.hour * 60 + now.minute\n        \n        # 每天凌晨重置话术\n        if now.hour == 0 and now.minute < 1:\n            daily_msgs.clear()\n            sent_today = {k for k in sent_today if k.startswith(date_key)}\n        \n        for hour, minute, task_type in SCHEDULE:\n            task_key = f\"{date_key}_{hour}_{minute}\"\n            task_minutes = hour * 60 + minute\n            \n            if task_key not in sent_today and abs(current_minutes - task_minutes) <= 0:\n                log(f\"🔔 触发任务: {hour:02d}:{minute:02d} ({task_type})\")\n                \n                # 随机选话术（当天同任务保持一致）\n                if task_type not in daily_msgs:\n                    daily_msgs[task_type] = random.choice(MESSAGES[task_type])\n                \n                msg = daily_msgs[task_type]\n                \n                # 起床 + 跑步加天气\n                if task_type in (\"wake\", \"run\"):\n                    weather = get_weather()\n                    weather_line = f\"\\n东莞天气：{weather}\" if weather else \"\"\n                    msg = f\"{msg}\\n{weather_line}\" if weather_line else msg\n                \n                send_message(msg)\n                sent_today.add(task_key)\n        \n        time.sleep(30)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780193145761}}
{"type":"message","id":"8effa05b","parentId":"9d86574f","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:05:57.173Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the full picture. The main loop runs every 30 seconds, checks if current time matches a scheduled task, and if so, sends the message.\n\nThe issue: I see that on 2026-05-31 at 06:30:13, the scheduler triggered the wake task. Then at 06:30:32, it restarted and triggered again (because `sent_today` is reset on restart, and the task hadn't been marked as sent). Then at 06:31:38 it restarted again.\n\nBut no \"✅ 推送成功\" or \"❌ 推送失败\" lines appear after the trigger. This means the process crashed inside `send_message` or `get_weather` before it could log the result.\n\nLooking at the flow:\n1. `log(f\"🔔 触发任务: ...\")` - this works, we see it in logs\n2. `weather = get_weather()` - this calls subprocess.run with curl\n3. `msg = f\"{msg}\\n{weather_line}\"` \n4. `send_message(msg)` - this calls get_token then requests.post\n5. `log(f\"✅ 推送成功: ...\")` or log failure\n\nIf the process crashes at step 4 or during weather fetch, we'd see the trigger but no result.\n\nThe fact that the scheduler keeps restarting suggests it's managed by something (probably the watchdog: crypto_monitor_watchdog.py or OpenClaw's process management). Each restart is a fresh process with an empty `sent_today` set, so the trigger fires again, crashes again, restart, loop.\n\nThe most likely cause: `send_message` calls `get_token()` which might be failing due to a network/API issue, and the exception isn't caught - or `requests.post` in get_token raises an exception that propagates up uncaught.\n\nActually wait - looking at get_token: if requests.post fails, it will raise an exception (not caught), which will crash the process. Or if the token file gets corrupted, json.load might fail. Or the API returns an unexpected format.\n\nLet me test the Feishu token and send message directly to see what happens.\n\nBut first, let me also check the watchdog process to see if it's restarting the scheduler.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_tJTBgxvKxvYCPQVCoswE5847","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -l \"reminder_scheduler\" ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_monitor_watchdog.py 2>/dev/null; echo \"===\"; grep \"reminder\" ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_monitor_watchdog.py 2>/dev/null | head -5","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":742,"output":1086,"cacheRead":25856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27684,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780193145775}}
