{"type":"message","id":"8fe77804","parentId":"d0a9bf15","timestamp":"2026-05-31T02:06:40.262Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Token and send message both work fine NOW. But earlier at 06:30, the scheduler crashed during the send. Let me think about what could have happened:\n\n1. The token API worked fine now\n2. The send message API worked fine now\n\nBut at 06:30, the scheduler triggered but crashed before logging success/failure. Possible reasons:\n- Network issue at that time (Clash proxy might have been down or slow)\n- The scheduler's get_token() call failed (maybe the cached token was still valid but the API call in send_message hung)\n- Process was killed by the watchdog due to some timeout\n\nWait, actually look at the log pattern:\n```\n[2026-05-31 06:30:13] 🔔 触发任务: 06:30 (wake)\n[2026-05-31 06:30:32] 🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\n[2026-05-31 06:30:32] 🔔 触发任务: 06:30 (wake)\n[2026-05-31 06:31:38] 🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\n[2026-05-31 07:30:08] 🔔 触发任务: 07:30 (breakfast)\n[2026-05-31 07:30:24] 🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\n[2026-05-31 07:30:24] 🔔 触发任务: 07:30 (breakfast)\n[2026-05-31 07:31:30] 🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\n```\n\nThe pattern is: trigger → ~20 seconds later restart → trigger again → ~66 seconds later restart. Each restart is presumably from the watchdog.\n\nThe `send_message` function calls `get_token()` which might be hanging on network requests. The sleep is 30 seconds. \n\nActually, I think the issue might be simpler - the `get_token()` function might be throwing an uncaught exception. Let me look at the token file:\n- The cached token at /tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json might be valid (expire is checked as `time.time() < expire - 300`)\n- If the cached token is valid, `get_token()` returns it directly\n\nBut wait - if the token file exists and has valid data, get_token returns without making an HTTP call. So send_message should just work with the cached token.\n\nThe watchdog is checking if the scheduler is running frequently. If it sees it's not running, it restarts it. But the scheduler process needs time to initialize and run through its loop.\n\nActually, let me re-read the log more carefully:\n\n```\n[2026-05-31 06:30:13] 🔔 触发任务: 06:30 (wake)\n```\n\nAt this point the scheduler was running from before. It triggered the wake task. But before it could complete the send, something happened...\n\n```\n[2026-05-31 06:30:32] 🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\n```\n\n19 seconds later, a new instance starts. This means the old instance died/crashed.\n\nThe bottleneck: the `send_message` calls `get_weather()` first for wake tasks, which uses `subprocess.run([\"curl\", \"-s\", ...])`. If curl is slow or blocked by Clash, this could take a while but shouldn't crash.\n\nActually, let me look at the script again. `get_weather()` uses `subprocess.run` with `capture_output=True` and `timeout=10`. If curl hangs (e.g., DNS issue), the timeout should kick in and raise `subprocess.TimeoutExpired` which is caught by `except Exception`.\n\nBut then `send_message(msg)` is called. If the token fetch works but the message send hangs (no timeout set in the main loop), the process could appear frozen.\n\nActually wait, I just realized: looking at the `send_message` function:\n```python\ndef send_message(text):\n    token = get_token()\n    resp = requests.post(..., timeout=10)\n```\n\nThe `requests.post` has `timeout=10`, so network timeout is handled there. But `get_token()` might also call `requests.post` which has `timeout=10`.\n\nThe exception handling: NONE of these functions catch exceptions! If `requests.post` raises a `ConnectionError` or `Timeout`, it will propagate up uncaught and crash the process.\n\nAt 06:30 in the morning, the Clash proxy might have been restarting or the network was unstable. This would cause the request to fail with a connection error, crashing the scheduler without logging the failure.\n\nSo the fix should be: add try/except around the send_message and get_token calls to handle network errors gracefully.\n\nLet me fix the script to add proper error handling.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了。今天早上 06:30 和 07:30 闹钟都触发了，但推送**没有成功**——日志里有「触发任务」但没有「推送成功」。问题出在 `get_token()` 和 `send_message()` 两个函数都没有异常处理：网络抖动或飞书 API 超时时，请求抛异常直接导致进程崩溃，日志里只留下触发记录却没有任何成功/失败标记。\n\n我帮你修一下，加上容错。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_WEp5Mb25lXWTVrBZjAnb4116","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py","old_string":"def get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取飞书 token\"\"\"\n    if TOKEN_FILE.exists():\n        try:\n            with open(TOKEN_FILE) as f:\n                data = json.load(f)\n            expire = data.get(\"expire\", 0)\n            if time.time() < expire - 300:\n                return data.get(\"token\")\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    resp = requests.post(\n        \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n        json={\"app_id\": FEISHU_APP_ID, \"app_secret\": FEISHU_APP_SECRET},\n        timeout=10\n    )\n    data = resp.json()\n    token = data.get(\"tenant_access_token\")\n    expire = int(data.get(\"expire\", 7200))\n    \n    with open(TOKEN_FILE, 'w') as f:\n        json.dump({\"token\": token, \"expire\": time.time() + expire}, f)\n    \n    return token","new_string":"def get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取飞书 token\"\"\"\n    if TOKEN_FILE.exists():\n        try:\n            with open(TOKEN_FILE) as f:\n                data = json.load(f)\n            expire = data.get(\"expire\", 0)\n            if time.time() < expire - 300:\n                return data.get(\"token\")\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    try:\n        resp = requests.post(\n            \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n            json={\"app_id\": FEISHU_APP_ID, \"app_secret\": FEISHU_APP_SECRET},\n            timeout=10\n        )\n        data = resp.json()\n        token = data.get(\"tenant_access_token\")\n        expire = int(data.get(\"expire\", 7200))\n        \n        with open(TOKEN_FILE, 'w') as f:\n            json.dump({\"token\": token, \"expire\": time.time() + expire}, f)\n        \n        return token\n    except Exception as e:\n        log(f\"⚠️ 获取飞书 Token 失败: {e}\")\n        raise"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":393,"output":2683,"cacheRead":27648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30724,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780193171418}}
