{"type":"message","id":"ab16f014","parentId":"016775a6","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:53:10.394Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Summary of errors:\n\n1. **K线重试 WARNING** - Sporadic SSL errors and proxy errors when fetching K-line data from Binance Testnet. These are transient network issues through the Clash proxy. The system retries (1/5 means it's on retry 1 of 5), and these don't seem to cascade into failures - they're sporadic and the system recovers.\n\n2. **BTC 已达最大持仓数** - Not really an error, it's the system correctly capping positions at 4.\n\nNo actual ERRORs, no tracebacks, no crashes. Just network wobbles from Binance Testnet through the proxy.\n\nLet me count the K-line errors to give a clear picture.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_5NgwCRixt55mFqddDnoe5762","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"今日K线重试次数：\"; grep \"K 线重试\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-05-31\" | wc -l; echo \"---\"; echo \"分布情况：\"; grep \"K 线重试\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-05-31\" | grep -oP \"(BTC|ETH|SOL|BNB|DOT|LINK|XRP)\" | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1139,"output":494,"cacheRead":47872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49505,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780231982779}}
