{"type":"message","id":"55bfdee5","parentId":"26a823ee","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:53:18.449Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, 4646 K-line retries? That seems very high. But looking at the distribution, it's roughly evenly spread across all 7 coins (~1310-1370 each). If the monitor runs every ~15 seconds and checks 7 coins, that's about 28 checks per minute, ~1680 per hour, ~40,000 per day...\n\nBut 4646 retries is substantial. Let me check what times of day these are happening and whether there are cascading failures. Let me also check if there are actual ERROR-level logs (not just WARNING retries).\n\nActually, looking more carefully, the distribution is very even - about 1300-1370 per coin. This suggests a systemic issue with the K-line API endpoint, not specific to any coin.\n\nWait, but earlier today these were pretty quiet. Let me check the hourly distribution.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_mSc84UiKGmI1Uo0N9S6i3307","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep \"K 线重试\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-05-31\" | grep -oP \"\\d{2}:\\d{2}\" | cut -d: -f1 | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":137,"output":487,"cacheRead":49280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49904,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780231990667}}
