{"type":"message","id":"6b1058ab","parentId":"7c2e5133","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:53:27.789Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the K-line retries were extremely concentrated in the early morning hours (00-07), with: \n- 00: 174 \n- 01: 638\n- 02: 638\n- 03: 628\n- 04: 622\n- 05: 650\n- 06: 632\n- 07: 638\n\nThat's about 4600+ retries in the midnight-to-morning window. After 08:00, it drops to almost nothing (single digits).\n\nThis is very likely the Clash proxy being unstable during those hours - either the proxy nodes were down, or the VPN subscription was having issues. The system is resilient and retries, but the root cause is probably the proxy.\n\nLet me also check if there are actual errors (not just retries) and if there were any failed orders.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_YZVH2AkXwJ7zP6rILeBv0884","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"=== 真正报错（ERROR/Exception/Traceback）===\"; grep -iE \"ERROR|Exception|Traceback\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-05-31\" | tail -5; echo \"总数: $(grep -iE 'ERROR|Exception|Traceback' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep '2026-05-31' | wc -l)\"; echo; echo \"=== 下单失败 ===\"; grep \"下单失败\" /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep \"2026-05-31\" | tail -3; echo \"总数: $(grep '下单失败' /root/.openclaw/logs/trading/monitor.log 2>/dev/null | grep '2026-05-31' | wc -l)\"","timeout":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":152,"output":631,"cacheRead":49664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50447,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780231998714}}
