{"type":"message","id":"84f719a6","parentId":"b63e0ea9","timestamp":"2026-05-31T12:53:38.144Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - 7238 ERROR/Exception/Traceback matches, but all are actually WARNING-level K-line retries (the grep is matching the word \"ERROR\" in the SSL error messages like \"SSLError\" and \"ProxyError\"). Let me filter more carefully.\n\nAlso important: 0 下单失败 - no order failures at all. That's good.\n\nAnd the K-line retries are WARNING level, not ERROR. The system retries and eventually succeeds.\n\nLet me present a clean summary:\n1. No actual ERROR-level logs, no crashes, no tracebacks\n2. K-line fetch has 4646 WARNING-level retries today, heavily concentrated in 00:00-07:00 (Clash proxy instability during late night)\n3. After 8:00, only sporadic single-digit retries\n4. 0 order failures\n5. BTC position cap warnings are normal behavior","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"没有真正的报错，但有高频告警 👑\n\n**K线数据拉取重试：4,646 次 WARNING**\n\n全部集中在凌晨 00:00-06:00，每小时 600+ 次，均匀分布在所有币种。天亮后（08:00 之后）骤降到个位数。\n\n根因是半夜 Clash 代理不稳定，连 Binance Testnet 频繁 SSL 错误 + 超时。系统有 5 次重试兜底，全部扛住了。\n\n**0 笔下单失败**，业务层没受影响。\n\n**其他：** 「BTC已达最大持仓数」每分钟一条，这是信号系统试图开 BTC 仓位但被 4 仓上限拦住的正常行为，不是错误。\n\n总结：没坏，就是代理夜里抖得厉害，不影响交易 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":690,"output":546,"cacheRead":50176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51412,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780232008183}}
